	<div class="entry-excerpt"><p>GAD3 is developing two international research projects surveying by telephone and online in five languages and eleven countries: Argentina, Colombia,&nbsp;Ecuador, France, Germany, Italy,&nbsp;Mexico, Peru,&nbsp;Spain, United Kingdom and USA. &nbsp; The projects are related to education and media consumtion. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&hellip;</p>
